flowchart TD
    START([PR Opened]) --> CI[GitHub Actions CI]
    CI --> PM_CHECK[Check packageManager = pnpm]
    PM_CHECK --> NODE_CHECK[Check Node >=20]
    NODE_CHECK --> DOCTOR[pnpm doctor]
    DOCTOR --> LINT[ESLint + Prettier]
    LINT --> TYPES[tsc --noEmit]
    TYPES --> VALIDATION[Run all validators]
    VALIDATION --> BUILD[Build index + packs]
    BUILD --> TESTS[Vitest suite]
    TESTS --> MERGE[✅ Merge to main]
    PM_CHECK --> FAIL[❌ Reject: npm/yarn detected]
    NODE_CHECK --> FAIL
    DOCTOR --> FAIL
    LINT --> FAIL
    TYPES --> FAIL
    VALIDATION --> FAIL
    BUILD --> FAIL
    TESTS --> FAIL
